## Traceability status

`specified` means documented; `mocked` means executable with local mock data; `tested` means covered by a spec; `integrated` is reserved for a real adapter/API; `blocked` requires customer/API clarification.

## Change protocol

Update the owning file's `Changed on`, `Changed by`, `Change reason`, `Affected UC`, and `Changelog` before merging code. Update cross-referenced files when a transition crosses business groups.
